  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into rounds.\n• Cut red onion into thick wedges.\n• Place zucchini and onion on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until just tender, 15 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839584e42dc4b92819887b9/step-325d8600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch and slice into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839584e42dc4b92819887b9/step-6196b010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add silverbeet and cook until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a bowl, then add cream cheese, lemon zest and Parmesan cheese. Season generously with salt and pepper. Stir until well combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839584e42dc4b92819887b9/step-3838e820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once zucchini is done, evenly stack 5 sheets of filo pastry (see ingredients) with a drizzle of olive oil between each layer and place on a second lined oven tray.\n• Spread silverbeet-cream cheese mixture over the centre of the pastry, leaving a 4cm border around the edges.\n• Top evenly with roasted zucchini, onion and snacking tomatoes.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839584e42dc4b92819887b9/step-be0aa630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving the centre exposed.\n• Bake tarts until golden, 15-20 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl combine rocket leaves, a drizzle of olive oil and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839584e42dc4b92819887b9/step-86b0f840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tart.\n• Divide loaded silverbeet and cream cheese tart between plates. Drizzle over tomato relish and top with rocket.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839584e42dc4b92819887b9/step-82d17d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
